---
layout: base.njk
current: home
title: Lumen Project
description: A non-profit redefining the concert as a communal happening through sound, light and space. Lie down, sleep, come and go. Stockholm.
permalink: /
---
<section class="hero">
  <img class="hero__img hero__img--day" src="/assets/img/photos/hero-day.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" />
  <img class="hero__img hero__img--dusk" src="/assets/img/photos/hero-dusk.jpg" alt="A Lumen Project performance in a sunlit hall, photographed by Olga Androsova" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
  <img class="hero__img hero__img--night" src="/assets/img/photos/hero-night.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" />
  <div class="hero__inner">
    <h1 class="wordmark">Lumen<span class="l2">Project</span></h1>
    <p class="hero__tag">{{ lumen.settings.tagline }}. You are welcome to lie down, sleep, or come and go freely.</p>

    <div class="hero__scrolls">
      <a class="hero__cta" href="#events">See events</a>
      {% if lumen.nextEvent %}<span class="nextev"><span class="k">Next</span> <a href="{{ lumen.nextEvent.url }}">{{ lumen.nextEvent.Title }}</a>, {{ lumen.nextEvent.Date | eventDate }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--center">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="manifest">The concert as a spiritual, communal happening. <span class="dim">Day into dusk into night.</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-sec" id="events" aria-label="Events">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% include "partials/events-sections.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-sec" id="artists" aria-label="Artists">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="page-intro">{{ lumen.artists.length }} musicians, composers and performers have shaped Lumen Project since 2017.</p>
    {% include "partials/artists-list.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-sec" id="about" aria-label="About">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="prose about-lead">
      <p>{{ lumen.settings.about }}</p>
      <p>{{ lumen.settings.founders }}</p>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/about-cols.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
